    "text": "A Statute to provide Supplementary Provisions to previously approved expenditure of the NorthernProvincial Council for the financial year 2016 by the Honorable Governor on the 25th day of December2015 in accordance to First Schedule to this statute and to make payments by way of advance out of theNorthern Provincial Council funds or monies to provide for the refund of such monies to the NorthernProvincial Council funds and to make provisions for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto.",
